90
00:06:09,600 --> 00:06:11,590
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What?!</font>

91
00:06:13,170 --> 00:06:16,000
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Is it a dinosaur egg?</font>

92
00:06:16,010 --> 00:06:19,170
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">No, it doesn't seem like it...</font>

93
00:06:19,180 --> 00:06:23,650
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Maybe God has left
