94
00:06:23,650 --> 00:06:25,280
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You can't be serious...</font>

95
00:06:25,280 --> 00:06:29,490
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">No, that <i>has</i> to be it!</font>

96
00:06:29,490 --> 00:06:30,990
