108
00:07:53,240 --> 00:07:59,010
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I thought that if he was lucky he might
have realized that fact for himself.</font>

109
00:07:59,020 --> 00:08:00,410
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You're sick.</font>

110
