112
00:08:12,090 --> 00:08:17,760
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">But even if Goku did die, I was prepared
to collect all the Dragon Balls...</font>

113
00:08:17,760 --> 00:08:22,330
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">...and bring him back to life along
with the others who were killed.</font>

114
00:08:22,330 --> 00:08:26,670
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You knew about the
Dragon Balls, Karin-<i>sama</i>?</font>

115
00:08:26,670 --> 00:08:28,240
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">But of course!</font>

116
00:08:28,240 --> 00:08:30,800
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">There is nothing I <i>don't</i> know!</font>

117
00:08:30,810 --> 00:08:35,380
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">So then you also know about how
