118
00:08:35,380 --> 00:08:36,810
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What?!</font>

119
00:08:53,560 --> 00:08:54,960
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">That can't be...</font>

120
00:08:54,960 --> 00:08:57,090
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Is what you say true?</font>

121
00:09:00,040 --> 00:09:02,450
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I see...</font>

122
00:09:02,450 --> 00:09:06,620
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I suppose if there was anyone who
could kill Shen Long, it would be him.</font>

123
00:09:06,620 --> 00:09:08,560
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Damn it!</font>

124
00:09:08,560 --> 00:09:13,730
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">If only Shen Long were still alive,
we could bring everyone back to life!</font>

125
00:09:13,730 --> 00:09:16,900
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">That's how things are, Goku.
It's called "fate."</font>

126
00:09:16,900 --> 00:09:22,360
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Even when people die because of diseases
or accidents, the regret lasts a lifetime.</font>

127
00:09:23,440 --> 00:09:26,540
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Yajirobe is correct.</font>

128
00:09:26,540 --> 00:09:30,780
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">But what's worse is that the
spirits of those slain by the Mazoku</font>

129
00:09:30,780 --> 00:09:33,880
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">will never find rest.</font>

130
00:09:33,880 --> 00:09:36,420
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Unable to make their
way to the other world,</font>

131
00:09:36,420 --> 00:09:39,510
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">they have no choice but to endure suffering
as they ceaselessly wander in limbo.</font>

132
00:09:49,830 --> 00:09:53,670
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Man, am I glad <i>I</i> didn't get killed...</font>

133
00:09:53,670 --> 00:09:58,980
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">That's terrible!
Isn't there anything we can do?!</font>

134
00:09:58,980 --> 00:10:04,570
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It's hopeless. With Shen Long gone,
