135
00:10:05,980 --> 00:10:07,380
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Oh!</font>

136
00:10:07,390 --> 00:10:08,750
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">That's right!</font>

137
00:10:08,750 --> 00:10:11,420
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">We may be able to do something after all!</font>

138
00:10:12,920 --> 00:10:14,520
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Really?!</font>

139
00:10:14,530 --> 00:10:18,960
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Where did my brain go? I can't believe
I forgot something so important!</font>

140
00:10:18,960 --> 00:10:20,960
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">So what do we do?!</font>

141
00:10:20,970 --> 00:10:24,630
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">This. You meet the person
who created the Dragon Balls</font>

142
00:10:24,640 --> 00:10:27,840
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">and ask him to bring Shen Long back to life!</font>

143
00:10:27,840 --> 00:10:31,640
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">The person who created the Dragon Balls?!</font>

144
00:10:31,640 --> 00:10:36,550
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You mean someone <i>made</i> those balls?</font>

145
00:10:36,550 --> 00:10:37,980
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Who?!</font>

146
00:10:37,980 --> 00:10:41,550
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Isn't it obvious?</font>

147
00:10:41,550 --> 00:10:43,550
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">God!</font>

148
00:10:43,550 --> 00:10:44,650
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">God?</font>

149
00:10:44,660 --> 00:10:50,490
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Ridiculous. God, of all things...</font>

150
00:10:50,490 --> 00:10:53,330
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">How can you say something
like that at a time like this?</font>

151
00:10:53,330 --> 00:10:56,830
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">So I just need to ask
that God guy, right?</font>

152
00:10:56,830 --> 00:10:58,870
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Hey, Son!</font>

153
00:10:58,870 --> 00:11:01,470
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Don't you know what you're saying?</font>

154
00:11:01,470 --> 00:11:02,970
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">This is God we're talking about!</font>

155
00:11:02,970 --> 00:11:05,710
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">There ain't no such person!</font>

156
00:11:05,710 --> 00:11:10,550
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">The only ones who can meet
God are people I approve of.</font>

157
00:11:10,550 --> 00:11:15,950
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Ones who are strong, powerful,
and possess a pure heart!</font>

158
00:11:15,950 --> 00:11:17,680
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Goku!</font>

159
00:11:18,780 --> 00:11:22,030
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You fit those qualifications perfectly!</font>

160
00:11:22,030 --> 00:11:24,130
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Unlike Yajirobe!</font>

161
00:11:24,130 --> 00:11:25,730
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Shut up!</font>

162
00:11:25,730 --> 00:11:28,630
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">So where should I go to meet him?</font>

163
00:11:28,630 --> 00:11:30,430
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">God lives in a temple.</font>

164
00:11:30,430 --> 00:11:33,000
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Above this tower.</font>

165
00:11:33,000 --> 00:11:37,540
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">See?! He's lying! We're already
