166
00:11:37,540 --> 00:11:41,110
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You're really starting to
get on my nerves, Yajirobe!</font>

167
00:11:41,110 --> 00:11:46,680
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">The temple floats in the
skies high above Karin Tower!</font>

168
00:11:46,680 --> 00:11:51,390
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It floats, you say?
Don't you <i>ever</i> quit joking?</font>

169
00:11:51,390 --> 00:11:53,160
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I don't see a thing.</font>

